menu "Sprout feature modules"

config FEATURE_OFFLINE_CONTENT
    bool "Enable offline content playback index"
    default y
    depends on FEATURE_CONFIG_STORE
    help
        Keeps a bounded index of the content packages pinned for offline
        playback, marks a package playable only after the library verified its
        bytes locally, and picks the next playable package. It stores metadata
        only: never content bytes, audio, images, credentials, or child data.

endmenu
